messages.en:
{07 16 00}It's not here!{01 00 00 05 00} It's not here!{01 00 00 05 00}
But no!{01 00 00 05 00} I have to believe!{01 00 00 05 00}
I can't lose faith!
{07 15 00}It's here.{01 00 00 05 00} I'm SURE it is!{01 00 00 0f 00}
{07 06 00}I am absolutely positive{01 00 00 05 00}
there's a fossil here{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.

