messages.en:
{07 14 00}If you want to find fossils,{01 00 00 05 00}
start digging early, before
anyone else wakes up.
{07 00 00}You know what they say...{07 0d 00}
The early bird gets the
petrified worm!

messages.et:
{07 14 00}Kui sa tahad fossiile leida,{01 00 00 05 00}
hakka varakult kaevama,
enne kui teised ärkavad.
{07 00 00}Tead, mida öeldakse...{07 0d 00}
Hommikune lind saab
kivistunud ussi!
